{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13203270","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13203270","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1320327001:1":{"text":"Hey, Levski! We've got a great news for you!","source_cn":"列夫斯基，有个好消息要告诉你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC3C23DD5A0816F35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1320327002:1":{"text":"Our friend is working on fixing your painting, and you'll get it back real soon!","source_cn":"我们的朋友决定帮你修复那副被损坏的画，等恢复原样后就会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF6DCF57A5C5D51E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320327003:1":{"text":"Oh, Dura above! Is... is that really true?! *Cough*","source_cn":"这……这是真的吗？！艾雅在上……咳、咳咳——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x85D4A5069494FB2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320327004:1":{"text":"Don't get too worked up! You need to stay calm!","source_cn":"别——别激动！你要尽量保持心情平和才行！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x449AB50AA49AFBF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320327005:1":{"text":"Ah, I'm just really happy; sorry about that...","source_cn":"哈、哈哈……我只是太高兴了，抱歉……咳……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56A51D90DAADCBB8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1320327005":{"text":"Ah, I'm just really happy; sorry about that...","source_cn":"哈、哈哈……我只是太高兴了，抱歉……咳……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56A51D90DAADCBB8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1320327006:1":{"text":"I get that you're thrilled, but your health is what matters most right now! How about I give you a quick health check-up?","source_cn":"我能理解你的心情，但还是保重身体最要紧！不如，我再来帮...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x444F86C0ECEDB8B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1320327007:1":{"text":"That would be great... to be honest, I can barely afford to go to the doctors... *Cough*","source_cn":"那就麻烦了……实不相瞒，我已经快要看不起医生了，咳……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE69855A20B9D1915","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1320327008:1":{"text":"...!","source_cn":"……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA75ECAFA62B2D23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1320327009:1":{"text":"How am I doing? Will my body last until the painting is fixed...?","source_cn":"怎、怎么样？我的身体，能坚持到那幅画修好的时候吗……","status":"matched","hash_xxh6